      "title": "Dilation scale factors",
      "statement": "Find the scale factor of a dilation.",
      "rule_summary": "Scale factor = image length/original length. For positive k, 0 < k < 1 gives a reduction and k > 1 gives an enlargement. A dilation preserves angle measures.",
